// The points-to stage, bounded: what Argus.Analysis.Extraction runs when
// the exact stage (points_to.dl) outgrows its budget. The same program,
// held to the same budget, with the leaves a coarse pass finds pervasive
// resolved by that pass (clientlib/pervasive.dl); it writes the same
// relations, points_to_mode saying "bounded", and which leaves it
// resolved so (pervasive.csv), for the caller to report.

.include "points_to.dl"

stage_mode("bounded").
